# cmakelint configuration (see `cmakelint --help`; only "filter=" is supported).
# Disabled rules (verified by running cmakelint over this tree's CMake files):
#   linelength           - root CMakeLists.txt and several Find*.cmake modules
#                          already contain lines longer than 80 chars.
#   convention/filename  - vendored Find modules keep their upstream-cased
#                          filenames (FindDjInterop.cmake, FindEbur128.cmake,
#                          FindLibudev.cmake, ...); renaming would break
#                          find_package() calls.
#   package/stdargs      - those same modules define case-preserved package
#                          variables (${Chromaprint}_INCLUDE_DIR, ...).
# All other cmakelint rules remain active.
filter=-linelength,-convention/filename,-package/stdargs
